100000************************************************************
100100*                    B L O W U P                           *
100200*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
100300*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
100400*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
100500*                                                          *
100600*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
100700*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
100800*                                                          *
100900*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
101100************************************************************
